    {
      "id": "u_c05df1e96029cb6b76e79963_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium allows you to save common searches as notes within the note tree. The search results will appear as sub-notes under these \"saved search\" notes. Here is an example of how it works:",
      "sourceHash": "c05df1e96029cb6b76e799631e376b7ec273e69d0c8f52330ff9fb3a975717e1",
      "context": "Saved Search",
      "contextHash": "9b2b20ae76cce84582e1495ef1ab037fd4ffd93ebfb5a0c20975d9f944fcb06f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumでは、よく使う検索条件をノートツリー内のノートとして保存できます。検索結果は、これらの「保存された検索」ノートの下位ノートとして表示されます。動作例は以下の通りです：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4984c6387ad262c28d98dfd5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A saved search runs when you open it, and when you expand it in the note tree. A saved search in a tab that is not shown, such as a background tab restored at startup, runs when you switch to that tab. Its results stay until you run the search again with the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ button of the search parameters. If the query has an error, it appears as a notification.",
      "sourceHash": "4984c6387ad262c28d98dfd542350bb8919a27bfda4ec6e252c814902580d4d7",
      "context": "Saved Search",
      "contextHash": "9b2b20ae76cce84582e1495ef1ab037fd4ffd93ebfb5a0c20975d9f944fcb06f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "保存された検索は、開いたときおよびノートツリーで展開したときに実行されます。起動時に復元されるバックグラウンドタブなど、表示されていないタブ内の保存された検索は、そのタブに切り替えたときに実行されます。検索結果は、検索パラメータの __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ ボタンで再度検索を実行するまで保持されます。クエリにエラーがある場合は、通知として表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b13d09159c1eb21f8134dac3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In __TRILIUM_PH_0__Safe mode__TRILIUM_PH_1__, and when the request fails, the search does not run on its own. Press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Search now__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to run it.",
      "sourceHash": "b13d09159c1eb21f8134dac32dc99e7a38bff7fe7bd8fcf81365287c2cae6673",
      "context": "Saved Search",
      "contextHash": "9b2b20ae76cce84582e1495ef1ab037fd4ffd93ebfb5a0c20975d9f944fcb06f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Safe mode__TRILIUM_PH_1__ 中や、リクエストが失敗した場合には、検索は自動的に実行されません。__TRILIUM_PH_2__Search now__TRILIUM_PH_3__ を押して実行してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f0b873a54c056d2e81371a27_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once a search is saved, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search parameters__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is still available underneath the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Title__TRILIUM_PH_3__ in order to be able to change the settings later on but it will appear collapsed by default.",
      "sourceHash": "f0b873a54c056d2e81371a2700d008e0b6be067799cc02a7721eecee52f8bc6d",
      "context": "Saved Search",
      "contextHash": "9b2b20ae76cce84582e1495ef1ab037fd4ffd93ebfb5a0c20975d9f944fcb06f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "検索を保存した後も、後から設定を変更できるように __TRILIUM_PH_0__検索パラメータ__TRILIUM_PH_1__ が __TRILIUM_PH_2__タイトル__TRILIUM_PH_3__ の下に利用可能な状態で残りますが、デフォルトでは折りたたまれた状態で表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-15T05:28:10.674Z"
    },
