    {
      "id": "u_643b856a91c2e4aa1750c680_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, saved searches are stored in the day note. However, you can designate a different note to store saved searches by marking it with the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ label. Additionally, for __TRILIUM_PH_1__workspaces__TRILIUM_PH_2__, you can use the __TRILIUM_PH_3__ label to specify a storage location for saved searches within that workspace.",
      "sourceHash": "643b856a91c2e4aa1750c680b336c8253487f6bb11add3a60e49f83d1568fa4c",
      "context": "Saved Search > Location",
      "contextHash": "4637387c0899c385214f3e485fcc41d23211820c28d2647174ca07be21f36bf9",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "デフォルトでは、保存された検索はデイリーノートに保存されます。ただし、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ ラベルを指定することで、保存された検索を格納する別のノートを指定できます。さらに、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ワークスペース__TRILIUM_PH_2__ の場合は、__TRILIUM_PH_3__ ラベルを使用して、そのワークスペース内の保存された検索の保存場所を指定できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
